Package: genreg
Title: Creating and conducting phylogenetic regressions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Apple", "Leavy", , "isabelle.leavy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Saida", "Tokmurzina", "st39854@my.utexas.edu", role = c("aut")))
Description: This package starts with mitochondrial DNA data from multiple species and provides the tools needed to build a phylogeny and conduct linear and multiple phylogenetic regressions.
